{"data":[{"id":3095,"text":"Aujourd'hui nous sommes le 18 juin et c'est l'anniversaire de Muiriel\u202f!","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":5,"text":"\u4eca\u5929\u662f\uff16\u6708\uff11\uff18\u53f7\uff0c\u4e5f\u662fMuiriel\u7684\u751f\u65e5\uff01","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3108,"text":"Pour une certaine raison le microphone ne marchait pas tout \u00e0 l'heure.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":18,"text":"\u525b\u624d\u6211\u7684\u9ea5\u514b\u98a8\u6c92\u8d77\u4f5c\u7528\uff0c\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u70ba\u4ec0\u9ebc\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3116,"text":"Il se peut que j'abandonne bient\u00f4t et fasse une sieste \u00e0 la place.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":25,"text":"\u4e5f\u8bb8\u6211\u4f1a\u9a6c\u4e0a\u653e\u5f03\u7136\u540e\u53bb\u6253\u76f9\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3121,"text":"Je ne peux que me demander si c'est la m\u00eame chose pour tous les autres.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501302,"text":"\u6211\u53ea\u80fd\u95ee\u81ea\u5df1\u8fd9\u5bf9\u5176\u4ed6\u6240\u6709\u4eba\u662f\u4e0d\u662f\u4e00\u56de\u4e8b\u5462\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3134,"text":"La derni\u00e8re personne \u00e0 qui j'ai racont\u00e9 mon id\u00e9e a pens\u00e9 que j'\u00e9tais cingl\u00e9.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501305,"text":"\u6700\u540e\u4e00\u4e2a\u542c\u6211\u8bf4\u6211\u7684\u4e3b\u610f\u7684\u4eba\u8ba4\u4e3a\u6211\u75af\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3137,"text":"Ils sont trop occup\u00e9s \u00e0 se battre entre eux pour s'occuper d'id\u00e9aux communs.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501308,"text":"\u4ed6\u4eec\u5435\u5f97\u4e0d\u53ef\u5f00\u4ea4\uff0c\u4ee5\u81f3\u4e8e\u6ca1\u6709\u4e13\u6ce8\u4e8e\u5171\u540c\u7684\u7406\u60f3\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3148,"text":"Pour une raison que j'ignore, je me sens plus vivant la nuit.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501315,"text":"\u7531\u4e8e\u67d0\u79cd\u539f\u56e0\uff0c\u6211\u665a\u4e0a\u4f1a\u89c9\u5f97\u66f4\u751f\u9f99\u6d3b\u864e\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3154,"text":"L'Am\u00e9rique est un endroit charmant pour vivre, si c'est pour gagner de l'argent.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ipridian","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501320,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u662f\u4e3a\u4e86\u8d5a\u94b1\u7684\u8bdd\uff0c\u7f8e\u56fd\u662f\u4e2a\u8bf1\u60d1\u4eba\u5c45\u4f4f\u7684\u5730\u65b9\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3158,"text":"Je ne suis pas un vrai poisson, je ne suis qu'une simple peluche.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":423383,"text":"\u6211\u4e0d\u662f\u4e00\u6761\u771f\u7684\u9c7c\uff0c\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u4e00\u4e2a\u957f\u6bdb\u7ed2\u73a9\u5177\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3161,"text":"Je me suis toujours demand\u00e9 ce que \u00e7a ferait d'avoir des fr\u00e8res et s\u0153urs.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501323,"text":"\u6211\u603b\u662f\u60f3\u6709\u5144\u5f1f\u59d0\u59b9\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u6837\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3176,"text":"\u00c0 l'\u00e9poque du lyc\u00e9e je me levais \u00e0 6h tous les matins.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":55,"text":"\u4ee5\u524d\u8b80\u9ad8\u4e2d\u7684\u6642\u5019\ufe50\u6211\u6bcf\u5929\u65e9\u4e0a\u516d\u9ede\u8d77\u5e8a\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3183,"text":"Chaque personne qui est seule est seule parce qu'elle a peur des autres.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501340,"text":"\u6bcf\u4e2a\u5b64\u5355\u7684\u4eba\u662f\u5b64\u5355\u7684\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u4ed6\u5bb3\u6015\u5176\u4ed6\u4eba\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3185,"text":"Je ne suis pas un artiste. Je n'ai jamais eu l'esprit pour \u00e7a.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501341,"text":"\u6211\u4e0d\u662f\u4e2a\u827a\u672f\u5bb6\u3002\u6211\u4ece\u6765\u6ca1\u6709\u8fd9\u79cd\u7279\u8d28\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3186,"text":"Je ne peux pas lui dire maintenant. Ce n\u2019est pas si simple.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"zmoo","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501342,"text":"\u6211\u73b0\u5728\u6ca1\u6cd5\u8ddf\u4ed6\u8bf4\u3002\u6ca1\u90a3\u4e48\u7b80\u5355\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3187,"text":"Je suis une personne qui a des d\u00e9fauts, mais ces d\u00e9fauts peuvent \u00eatre facilement corrig\u00e9s.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501343,"text":"\u6211\u662f\u4e2a\u6709\u7f3a\u70b9\u7684\u4eba\uff0c\u4f46\u8fd9\u4e9b\u7f3a\u70b9\u5f88\u5bb9\u6613\u5c31\u80fd\u88ab\u6539\u6b63\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3188,"text":"Chaque fois que je trouve quelque chose que j'aime, c'est trop cher.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"brauliobezerra","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501344,"text":"\u6bcf\u6b21\u6211\u53d1\u73b0\u4ec0\u4e48\u6211\u559c\u6b22\u7684\u4e1c\u897f\uff0c\u90fd\u592a\u8d35\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3193,"text":"Je ne veux pas perdre mes id\u00e9es, m\u00eame si certaines d'entre elles sont un peu extr\u00eames.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":454662,"text":"\u6211\u4e0d\u60f3\u653e\u5f03\u6211\u7684\u60f3\u6cd5\uff0c\u867d\u7136\u4e00\u4e9b\u60f3\u6cd5\u6709\u70b9\u6781\u7aef\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"peipei","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3196,"text":"Tu es en train de dire que tu caches intentionnellement ta beaut\u00e9\u202f?","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501351,"text":"\u4f60\u662f\u8bf4\u4f60\u5728\u6545\u610f\u63a9\u9970\u4f60\u7684\u7f8e\u8c8c\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3198,"text":"Si quelqu'un devait demander quel est le but de l'histoire, je ne saurais vraiment pas.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501353,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u6709\u4eba\u95ee\u8d77\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6545\u4e8b\u7684\u7528\u610f\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff0c\u6211\u8fd8\u771f\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3200,"text":"Je pense que le fait que j'ai v\u00e9cu avec toi a influenc\u00e9 la fa\u00e7on dont tu vis.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501355,"text":"\u6211\u89c9\u5f97\u6211\u548c\u4f60\u4e00\u8d77\u4f4f\u5f71\u54cd\u4e86\u4f60\u751f\u6d3b\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3212,"text":"Apr\u00e8s \u00e7a, je pars, mais je me rends compte que j'ai oubli\u00e9 mon sac chez eux.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"ANH_DAO","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501374,"text":"\u63a5\u7740\uff0c\u6211\u8d70\u4e86\uff0c\u4f46\u6211\u610f\u8bc6\u5230\u6211\u628a\u5305\u5fd8\u5728\u4ed6\u4eec\u5bb6\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3217,"text":"Merci de m'avoir expliqu\u00e9 finalement pourquoi on me prend pour une imb\u00e9cile.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Tcha","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13850024,"text":"\u611f\u8b1d\u60a8\u7d42\u65bc\u7232\u6211\u8aaa\u660e\u4e86\u7232\u751a\u9ebc\u4eba\u5011\u901a\u901a\u628a\u6211\u7576\u50bb\u74dc\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"DaoSeng","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3223,"text":"\u00c7a m'a presque fait peur de ne pas te voir connect\u00e9e pendant toute une journ\u00e9e.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Tcha","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501401,"text":"\u4e00\u6574\u5929\u6ca1\u770b\u5230\u4f60\u4e0a\u7ebf\u8ba9\u6211\u51e0\u4e4e\u611f\u5230\u5bb3\u6015\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3234,"text":"Je ne sais pas comment le d\u00e9montrer vu que c'est trop \u00e9vident\u202f!","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Tcha","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501416,"text":"\u6211\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u600e\u4e48\u8868\u793a\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u592a\u660e\u663e\u4e86\uff01","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3235,"text":"J'aurais pas imagin\u00e9 qu'un jour j'irais chercher \u00ab\u202fviagra\u202f\u00bb dans Wikip\u00e9dia.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"sysko","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334247,"text":"\u6211\u4e0d\u4f1a\u60f3\u5230\u6709\u4e00\u5929\u6211\u4f1a\u5728\u7ef4\u57fa\u767e\u79d1\u67e5\u627e\u201c\u4f1f\u54e5\u201d\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3246,"text":"Je vais donc jouer au Sudoku au lieu de continuer de te d\u00e9ranger.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Tcha","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":335063,"text":"\u90a3\u6211\u5c31\u4e0d\u7ee7\u7eed\u6253\u6270\u4f60\uff0c\u73a9\u6570\u72ec\u6e38\u620f\u53bb\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3260,"text":"C'est in\u00e9vitable que j'aille en France un jour, je ne sais juste pas quand.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Tcha","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":335052,"text":"\u6709\u4e00\u5929\u6211\u53bb\u6cd5\u56fd\u662f\u65e0\u53ef\u907f\u514d\u7684\uff0c\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u4f55\u65f6\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3273,"text":"\u00ab\u00a0Je n'y ai jamais pens\u00e9\u00a0\u00bb, dit le vieil homme. \u00ab\u00a0Que devrions-nous faire\u00a0?\u00a0\u00bb","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":335040,"text":"\u201c\u6211\u4ece\u6ca1\u60f3\u8fc7\u201d\uff0c\u8001\u5148\u751f\u8bf4\u9053\uff1a\u201c\u6211\u4eec\u8be5\u505a\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f\u201d","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3276,"text":"Qu'est-ce que tu crois que j'\u00e9tais en train de faire\u202f?","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Tcha","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":335037,"text":"\u4f60\u89c9\u5f97\u6211\u4e4b\u524d\u5728\u505a\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3285,"text":"Pourquoi es-tu d\u00e9sol\u00e9e pour quelque chose que tu n'as pas fait\u202f?","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Tcha","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334920,"text":"\u4e3a\u4ec0\u4e48\u4f60\u8981\u5bf9\u4f60\u6ca1\u505a\u8fc7\u7684\u4e8b\u8868\u793a\u62b1\u6b49\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3304,"text":"Est-ce que tu as vraiment besoin de poser la question pour conna\u00eetre la r\u00e9ponse\u202f?","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"SUZIE","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334710,"text":"\u4f60\u771f\u7684\u9700\u8981\u63d0\u95ee\u9898\u6765\u77e5\u9053\u7b54\u6848\u5417\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3311,"text":"\u00c7a me prendrait trop de temps pour t'expliquer pourquoi \u00e7a ne va pas marcher.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"trotter","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334703,"text":"\u7ed9\u4f60\u89e3\u91ca\u8fd9\u4e3a\u4ec0\u4e48\u884c\u4e0d\u901a\u8981\u82b1\u5f88\u591a\u65f6\u95f4\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3312,"text":"Je suis trop b\u00eate... J'essaie de t'expliquer des choses que je ne comprends pas moi-m\u00eame.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"sysko","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334702,"text":"\u6211\u592a\u611a\u8822\u4e86...\u6211\u7adf\u7136\u8bd5\u7740\u7ed9\u4f60\u89e3\u91ca\u6211\u81ea\u5df1\u90fd\u4e0d\u61c2\u7684\u4e1c\u897f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3322,"text":"\u00ab Qu'est-ce qui ne va pas\u202f? \u00bb demanda le petit lapin blanc.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"SUZIE","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334487,"text":"\u201c\u600e\u4e48\u56de\u4e8b\uff1f\u201d\u5c0f\u767d\u5154\u95ee\u9053\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3325,"text":"Nous devons apprendre \u00e0 vivre ensemble comme des fr\u00e8res, ou nous p\u00e9rirons ensemble comme des idiots.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"trotter","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334481,"text":"\u6211\u4eec\u5fc5\u987b\u5b66\u4f1a\u50cf\u5144\u5f1f\u4e00\u6837\u5171\u540c\u751f\u6d3b\uff0c\u8981\u4e48\u5c31\u50cf\u50bb\u5b50\u4e00\u6837\u540c\u5f52\u4e8e\u5c3d\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3329,"text":"\u00ab C'est ce que j'\u00e9tais en train de chercher \u00bb, s'exclama-t-il.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"trotter","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334477,"text":"\u201c\u8fd9\u6b63\u662f\u6211\u5728\u627e\u7684\u3002\u201d\u4ed6\u558a\u9053\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3331,"text":"Il se peut que leur communication soit beaucoup plus complexe que nous le pensions.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"trotter","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334475,"text":"\u5f88\u53ef\u80fd\u4ed6\u4eec\u7684\u4ea4\u6d41\u6bd4\u6211\u4eec\u60f3\u7684\u66f4\u590d\u6742\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3338,"text":"Fais-moi savoir s'il y a quoi que ce soit que je puisse faire.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"trotter","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334468,"text":"\u8ba9\u6211\u77e5\u9053\u662f\u5426\u6709\u4ec0\u4e48\u6211\u80fd\u505a\u7684\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3340,"text":"C'est \u00e0 toi de d\u00e9cider si nous allons l\u00e0-bas ou non.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"trotter","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334463,"text":"\u8be5\u7531\u4f60\u6765\u51b3\u5b9a\u6211\u4eec\u53bb\u4e0d\u53bb\u90a3\u513f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true},{"id":406365,"text":"\u6211\u4eec\u53bb\u4e0d\u53bb\u90a3\u513f\u7531\u4f60\u6765\u51b3\u5b9a\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true},{"id":10531113,"text":"\u4f60\u6c7a\u5b9a\u6211\u5011\u53bb\u4e0d\u53bb\u90a3\u5152\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"DaoSeng","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3344,"text":"\u00ab Ne nous sommes-nous pas rencontr\u00e9s quelque part avant\u202f? \u00bb demanda l'\u00e9tudiant.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"trotter","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334459,"text":"\u201c\u4ee5\u524d\u6211\u4eec\u6ca1\u5728\u54ea\u513f\u89c1\u8fc7\u5417\uff1f\u201d\u5b66\u751f\u95ee\u9053\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3350,"text":"Dans les ann\u00e9es 50, on citait les Finnois comme ayant les r\u00e9gimes alimentaires les moins sains du monde.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Sbgodin","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334453,"text":"50\u5e74\u4ee3\uff0c\u82ac\u5170\u4eba\u88ab\u8ba4\u4e3a\u662f\u4e16\u754c\u4e0a\u996e\u98df\u6700\u4e0d\u5065\u5eb7\u7684\u4f8b\u5b50\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3359,"text":"\u00ab\u00a0Pourquoi tu n'y vas pas\u00a0?\u00a0\u00bb \u00ab\u00a0Parce que je ne veux pas.\u00a0\u00bb","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"kurisutofu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334446,"text":"\"\u4f60\u4e3a\u4ec0\u4e48\u4e0d\u53bb\uff1f\"\"\u56e0\u4e3a\u6211\u4e0d\u60f3\u53bb\u3002\"","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3361,"text":"Je suis venu \u00e0 Tokyo il y a trois ans et ai v\u00e9cu ici depuis.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"kurisutofu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334444,"text":"\u4e09\u5e74\u524d\u6211\u6765\u5230\u4e1c\u4eac\u5e76\u4e00\u76f4\u4f4f\u5728\u8fd9\u513f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3363,"text":"Ce n'est pas rare du tout de vivre plus de 90 ans.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"kurisutofu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334442,"text":"\u6d3b\u523090\u5c81\u4ee5\u4e0a\u4e00\u70b9\u90fd\u4e0d\u7a00\u5947\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3368,"text":"Quand on commence \u00e0 ressembler \u00e0 la photo de son passeport, on devrait partir en vacances.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"kurisutofu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501426,"text":"\u5f53\u6211\u4eec\u5f00\u59cb\u50cf\u81ea\u5df1\u62a4\u7167\u4e0a\u7684\u7167\u7247\u65f6\uff0c\u6211\u4eec\u8be5\u53bb\u5ea6\u5047\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3371,"text":"Avec autant de personnes autour de lui, il devint naturellement un peu nerveux.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"kurisutofu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334436,"text":"\u4ed6\u88ab\u5f88\u591a\u4eba\u56f4\u7740\uff0c\u81ea\u7136\u53d8\u5f97\u6709\u70b9\u7d27\u5f20\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":3377,"text":"T'as eu de la chance parce qu'il ne t'a pas mordu.","lang":"fra","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"kurisutofu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334430,"text":"